  s4 --> s8: confirm again [the id is an attempt]
  s4 --> s7: the provider returns an id
  s6 --> s7: lookup accepts or repair [no transport]
  s7 --> s9: confirm the sealed receipt again
  s8 --> s1: the provider rejects
  s8 --> s7: the provider returns an id
